<title>USA: Waukesha, Wis., $2.445 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Waukesha, Wis., $2.445 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $2.445 million of Waukesha, Wis., general obligation community development refunding bonds, Series 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 5.0925 percent.</p>
